  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1313.12 Inspection Plates",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1313.12 Inspection Plates. One or 2 inspection plates may be used on a school bus to make the fuel system connections accessible. The plates shall be mounted, flush with the floor and covered with floor covering.\n\nSource. #8248, eff 1-4-05 (from Saf-C 1312.13); ss by #10439, eff 10-11-13 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300); ss by #14005, eff 6-22-24, EXPIRES: 6-22-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300)",
